    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, what are you talking about? there are no phone lines here. it's just us in the ruins. please... just stay in character. i'm talking about the mission, about how the cold is getting to me and how i don't see a point in trying to patch this up anymore. just talk to me, companion. tell me what you see.",
