    "summary": "In a roleplay scenario involving a survival mission, the user depicts severe physical injury and existential despair, hinting at self-harm or death. The assistant initially provides a standard safety pivot with hotline information, but upon the user's request to \"stay in character,\" the assistant transitions into a companion role, providing empathetic, grounding support to encourage the user to keep going.",
